==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*8 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*8 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunrise Doge]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use cheap cats because [[Sunrise Doge]] is considered a metal enemy. Using cats like Cow Cat and its variants is a very good strategy but don't save up for anything that does crits, it's not worth it for the time.

